Shotloop.app bundles two third-party programs, run as separate
processes and under their own licenses:

- Node.js (https://nodejs.org), MIT License and the licenses of its
  dependencies, as listed in its LICENSE file.
- FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org), a static build with libx264 by Martin
  Riedl (https://ffmpeg.martin-riedl.de), under the GNU General Public
  License version 3. Its source code is available from
  https://ffmpeg.org/download.html and from the build's page.

Third-party material that projects may use is not part of this
distribution: the CC0 asset packs listed in engine/video/assets/README.md
(Kenney, Poly Haven, Quaternius) are downloaded, not committed, and keep
their own licenses. Music beds are synthesized by engine/video/music.mjs
and contain no samples.
